JAATI HAI NABI ZAADIYAN AB LUTT KE WATAN KO. <br>
 YE KISKI NAZAR KHAGAYI ZEHRA KE CHAMAN KO.<br>
<br>
1. KUBRA NE KAHA BOLIYE AB KISKE SAHARE. <br>
 AYE IBNE HASAN CHOOD GAYE APNI DULHAN KO.<br>
<br>
2. HAATON PE SHAIHEY WAALA KE MAARA GAYA BESHEER. <br>
 PAANI BHI MAYASSAR NA HUWA TASHNADAHAN KO.<br>
<br>
3. MAZLOOM KA LAASHA THA PADA JALTI ZAMEEN PAR. <br>
 HASRAT SE BEHAN DEKHTI THI SHAHE ZAMAN KO.<br>
<br>
4. DARIYA KI TARAF DEKH KE ZAINAB NE SADA DI. <br>
 AB AAKEY AAMARI MAY BITHAO TOU BEHAN KO.<br>
<br>
5. QABR E SHAHEY WAALA PE KAHA BINTE ALI NE. <br>
 AYE BHAI ZARA DEKHIYE AB UTHH KE BEHAN KO.<br>
<br>
6. SEENE MAY JAWAAN LAAL KE PAIWAST JO DEKHI. <br>
 MEHSOOS HARAM KARTE HAIN WO BARCHI KI CHUBHAN KO.<br>
<br>
7. SHAI NE KAHA ZAINAB SE YEH SAR PEET KE SAAHIL. <br>
 PAAMAL LAAENO NE KIYA IBNE HASAN KO.<br>
<br>
AZZ:ALAMDAR SAAHIL